4. **Model:** coverage islands (gaps-and-islands), member-level retention fact, person-month table: [`sql/02_marts/`](sql/02_marts/).
5. **Answer the business questions**, one SQL file each: [`sql/03_analysis/`](sql/03_analysis/).
   - [`01_cohort_retention_matrix.sql`](sql/03_analysis/01_cohort_retention_matrix.sql)
